    "Register your interest": "注册您的意向",
    "Why the Kenya-China tea conversation matters now": "为何肯尼亚-中国茶叶对话在当下至关重要",
    "Zero tariffs removed one cost barrier this year. They did not remove the others.": "零关税消除了今年的一项成本壁垒。但并未消除其他壁垒。",
    "Kenya and China already have a tea relationship. Its potential is larger than current trade volumes suggest, and the gap between the two is the reason this summit exists.": "肯尼亚与中国已经建立了茶叶贸易关系。其潜力远大于目前的贸易量,两者之间的差距正是本次峰会存在的原因。",
    "Kenya has generations of knowledge in tea cultivation, processing and international trade, with a growing focus on orthodox, green, specialty and value-added products. China is a major tea market and a centre for tea production, technology, product development and tea culture.": "肯尼亚在茶叶种植、加工和国际贸易方面拥有世代积累的知识,并日益注重传统工艺茶、绿茶、特色茶和增值产品。中国是主要茶叶市场,也是茶叶生产、技术、产品开发和茶文化的中心。",
    "Access improved this year": "今年准入条件改善",
    "On 1 May 2026, China extended zero-tariff treatment to imports from all African countries with diplomatic relations with Beijing (<a href=\"https://english.news.cn/20260501/4a61884b19384e9995c54ba065ca32c5/c.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Xinhua, 1 May 2026</a>). For Kenyan exporters, that removes a cost barrier at the border.": "2026年5月1日,中国对所有与北京建交的非洲国家进口商品实施零关税待遇(<a href=\"https://english.news.cn/20260501/4a61884b19384e9995c54ba065ca32c5/c.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新华社,2026年5月1日</a>)。对肯尼亚出口商而言,这消除了边境的一项成本壁垒。",
    "It does not create demand. Exporters still need products that fit the market, reliable buyer relationships, clear documentation, strong quality systems and effective distribution. Buyers need suppliers who can deliver the right product, quality, volume and traceability, consistently.": "但这并不创造需求。出口商仍需要适合市场的产品、可靠的买家关系、清晰的文件、强大的质量体系和有效的分销渠道。买家需要能够持续提供正确产品、质量、数量和可追溯性的供应商。",
    "The first quarter shows the difference": "第一季度数据显示出差异",
    "Kenya's tea exports to China fell to 1.22 million kilograms in the first quarter of 2026, down 51% on the same period in 2025 (<a href=\"https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/kenya-tea-exports-rise-6-in-q1-2026-as-pakistan-strengthens-lead/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Food Business Middle East &amp; Africa, 6 June 2026</a>).": "2026年第一季度,肯尼亚对中国的茶叶出口量降至122万公斤,比2025年同期下降51%(<a href=\"https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/kenya-tea-exports-rise-6-in-q1-2026-as-pakistan-strengthens-lead/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Food Business Middle East &amp; Africa,2026年6月6日</a>)。",
    "Two things are worth holding together. The first is that this is a single quarter, measured before the tariff change took effect on 1 May — it describes the market the policy was designed to address, not the policy's result. The second is that Kenya's total tea exports rose 6% over the same period, to 144.46 million kilograms, led by record shipments to Pakistan. The China figure is not a story about Kenyan tea losing ground generally. It is a story about one market where the commercial relationships are thinner than the opportunity.": "有两点值得同时关注。第一,这是单个季度的数据,是在5月1日关税变更生效之前测算的——它描述的是政策旨在应对的市场状况,而非政策的结果。第二,同期肯尼亚茶叶出口总量增长了6%,达到1.4446亿千克,主要得益于对巴基斯坦的创纪录出口量。中国市场的数据并非说明肯尼亚茶叶整体失去优势,而是反映了在一个商业关系相对薄弱但机遇存在的市场中的情况。",
    "That is a coordination problem, and it is the kind a summit can address.": "这是一个协调问题,而峰会正是可以解决此类问题的平台。",
    "What the opportunity actually involves": "机遇的实际内涵",
    "The work is broader than selling more bulk tea. It includes product development for Chinese preferences, processing technology, packaging, branding, direct sourcing relationships, traceability, research and investment. It also requires a clearer understanding of what Chinese buyers and consumers value, which is difficult to acquire at a distance.": "这项工作的范畴不仅限于销售更多散装茶叶,还包括针对中国消费偏好的产品开发、加工技术、包装、品牌建设、直接采购关系、可追溯性、研究和投资。同时也需要更清晰地了解中国买家和消费者的价值取向,而这在远距离情况下很难获得。",
    "The Kenya-China Tea Summit is intended to put those parts of the market in the same rooms. Producers hear directly from buyers. Technology providers meet the factories and growers who would use their equipment. Investors see where capital is needed. Public institutions can address the standards and trade processes that shape commercial decisions.": "Kenya-China Tea Summit旨在将市场的各个环节汇聚到同一空间。生产商直接听取买家意见,技术供应商与将使用其设备的工厂和种植者会面,投资者了解资本需求所在,公共机构可以处理影响商业决策的标准和贸易流程问题。",
    "The aim is practical: better information, stronger relationships, and more credible routes from opportunity to business.": "目标是务实的:更准确的信息、更牢固的关系,以及从机遇到业务的更可靠路径。",
    "Six categories, from delegate to exhibitor. Fees and deadlines are published once the secretariat confirms them.": "六个类别,从代表到参展商。费用和截止日期将在秘书处确认后公布。",
